              "value": {
                "kind": "scalar",
                "value": "# This directory is a HOUSEKEEPING BOARD: every `…/$defs:task` file in it is a card (a chore),\n# grouped into lanes by the `dev` workflow's states (backlog → ready → in-progress → done/cancelled).\n# Dragging a card to another lane rewrites that chore's state annotation (re-tags it). The\n# states come from the PROJECT-GLOBAL `dev` workflow (the root `ontos/` taxonomy) that the cards\n# also point at — one source of truth, no per-board copy. A member no lane references (the\n# grocery list) shows in the board's \"other\" section. Spec: ../../TICKETS.md §3.\n!!<*yamlover:$defs:board>\nworkflow: *::yamlover:ontos:workflow:dev\n",
